      "side": 1,
      "message": "Overall this is looking great! Some initial comments. To make it easier to review and land this, I suggest we split it into multiple changes. I suggest:\n 1. Vulkan only first, with some simple correctness tests and validation tests. This is because for Vulkan, first vertex / first instance already works. You should be able to test correctness, as well as all of the frontend synchronous validation rules.\n 2. Then in separate parallel CLs you can:\n   (a) add support for D3D12, with any changes needed for first vertex/instance\n   (b) add support for Metal. They should be mostly independent.\n   (c) write CTS tests to check the correctness of the GPU-based validation.\n       This will let you further validate the correctness of the GPU validation and Metal-specific validation",
      "revId": "d25efb86e2c14f3b458bd4806cca619b86a2602d",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
